  "title": "epan: Try to satisfy Coverity",
  "description": "fast_ensure_contiguous is an internal static function that is\nnever called with length 0. As written, if it were called with\nlength 0, it could in some cases dereference off the end of the\narray. Assert that it doesn't in order to try to please Coverity.\n(If this doesn't work, we might have to just mark it as intentional.)\n\nCoverity CID 1680448\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
